      "writtenOn": "2017-12-27T19:41:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "When SIM changes, instead of blindly changing this value to false, shouldnt the phone query from the network and update the preference accordingly ?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2360,
        "startChar": 20,
        "endLine": 2360,
        "endChar": 52
      },
      "revId": "cc00ccf8fccd94a7838f195f40d43db6e45a3c5f",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "43db0537_0fe28702",
        "filename": "src/java/com/android/internal/telephony/GsmCdmaPhone.java",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 2360,
      "author": {
        "id": 1140173
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-01-10T10:19:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Querying from network everytime the SIM changes is a costly operation. \nFor voice call forwarding, the SIM\u0027s Elementary file(EFCFIS), is having the info stored, and is read to update the CF status and show indicator.\nHere, since for video CF, we are storing in preferences, we are re-setting it to FALSE when SIM changes, instead of showing wrong info. \nSimilarly, we can see in above lines(2358, 2359), VoiceMailNumber, VmSimImsi are also reset.",
      "parentUuid": "4cd4c4c1_21994ad4",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2360,
        "startChar": 20,
        "endLine": 2360,
        "endChar": 52
      },
      "revId": "cc00ccf8fccd94a7838f195f40d43db6e45a3c5f",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "9b251d36_540a8948",
        "filename": "src/java/com/android/internal/telephony/GsmCdmaPhone.java",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 2360,
      "author": {
        "id": 1125174
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-01-18T22:35:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I feel that if we reset the Preference, we are actually showing wrong information to the user.",
      "parentUuid": "43db0537_0fe28702",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2360,
        "startChar": 20,
        "endLine": 2360,
        "endChar": 52
