      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "b4d23a5c_1c777911",
        "filename": "src/java/com/android/internal/telephony/PhoneInternalInterface.java",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 607,
      "author": {
        "id": 1125174
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-12-27T19:41:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is this returned array expected to be greater than size 1 only when CFReason is CF_REASON_ALL or CF_REASON_ALL_CONDITIONAL ? or can it be greater than 1 if the caller is querying both VOICE and VIDEO in the same API call?\n\nIt doesnt seem like setCallForwardingOption method below can set multiple Reasons at once. So it will be good to specify how exactly this response should be returned and when the returned value will be an array of size greater than 1.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 607,
        "startChar": 43,
        "endLine": 607,
        "endChar": 48
      },
      "revId": "cc00ccf8fccd94a7838f195f40d43db6e45a3c5f",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "40d09134_34872e4a",
        "filename": "src/java/com/android/internal/telephony/PhoneInternalInterface.java",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 607,
      "author": {
        "id": 1140173
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-01-10T10:19:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "1. The new overloaded API \"getCallForwardingOption\" has just introduced the \"commandInterfaceServiceClass\" parameter. Hence, the remaining documentation has been taken from the original API(line#562).\n\n2. The array of CallForwardInfo is not depending on CF Reason (ALL or CONDITIONAL). \nIf Call forwarding query is made without specifying any service class(from MMI code), then it will return one or more CallForwardInfo for each service class provided by that network.( say Voice, Fax etc.).\nCode reference: ImsPhoneMmiCode.java-\u003eonQueryCfComplete(AsyncResult ar)-\u003e line#1447\n\nThe array is generic and would have the size of 1 if the service class has been specified.",
      "parentUuid": "b4d23a5c_1c777911",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 607,
        "startChar": 43,
        "endLine": 607,
        "endChar": 48
      },
      "revId": "cc00ccf8fccd94a7838f195f40d43db6e45a3c5f",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
