      "writtenOn": "2018-01-10T10:19:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "allDataCircuitAsynchronous is having the decimal value \"80\". \nThis mask is achieved by using SERVICE_CLASS_DATA_SYNC(1\u003c\u003c4) and SERVICE_CLASS_PACKET (1\u003c\u003c6) which makes the total 80.\nThis combination value is provided by modem team.\nSERVICE_CLASS_DATA_ASYNC(1\u003c\u003c5) can\u0027t be used.",
